# Gemini CLI read-scope exclusions - PROVISIONAL (see docs/GEMINI_AUDIT_CONFIG.md)
# Gemini is read-only; this trims ingestion + hard-blocks secrets.

# Dated artifacts / archives
_archive/
docs/_archive/

# Dependencies + VCS internals
node_modules/
.git/

# Databases + large local runtime state
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
logs/
ops/runtime/

# Secrets / credentials - NEVER ingest
API-Key-Claude.txt
config/vision_token.txt
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Gemini's own channels - avoid self-ingest loops
gemini_io/
docs/EXTERNAL_REVIEW_*.md
